    <item>
      <title>倒影池承包商将损坏归咎于自己的维修，而不是破坏者</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/11/climate/reflecting-pool-contractor-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[文件显示，承包商表示，由于“人为疏忽”以及一项有缺陷的计划，该计划涉及将两种不相容的化学品分层，因此游泳池的新蓝色衬垫剥落和撕裂。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/11/climate/reflecting-pool-contractor-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 17:39:48 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
